  "title": "Naturally Crisp Uruguayan Fish Ceviche",
  "description": "A winey and crisp Uruguayan dish featuring white vinegar, made in a fondue pot, with a nostalgic touch, this satvik friendly ceviche is perfect for any occasion, the papillote cooking method ensures the fish is cooked to perfection",
