  "instructions": [
    "Cut the halibut fillets into small pieces and place them in the fondue pot",
    "Add the white vinegar, lime juice, olive oil, minced onion, minced bell pepper, chopped cilantro, salt, and black pepper to the fondue pot",
    "Stir gently to combine",
    "Cover the fondue pot with papillote paper to create a steamy environment",
    "Let it cook for 5 minutes or until the fish is opaque and flakes easily",
    "Remove the papillote paper and stir gently",
    "Serve immediately",
    "Garnish with additional chopped cilantro if desired"
